{
  "id": "6ad5d3c44f0b24507a24310f",
  "title": "シンプル化の問い",
  "created": 1792398281,
  "updated": 1792421904,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c44f0b24507a24310f",
      "text": "シンプル化の問い",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792398281
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982caa",
      "text": "\t手放せるものはあるか？",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792398282
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982cac",
      "text": "\t「[十分]」とはどの程度か？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792421904
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982cad",
      "text": "\t本当に知るべきことは何か？",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792398281
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982cae",
      "text": "\t本当に[注目]すべきことは何か？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792421895
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982caf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792398281
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3d70000000000982cb7",
      "text": "もすこし詳しく:",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398296,
      "updated": 1792398300
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3db0000000000982cb8",
      "text": "\t〈意欲〉が〈がんばりすぎ〉になったら問うこと：手放せるものはあるか？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398300,
      "updated": 1792421860
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3db0000000000982cb9",
      "text": "\t〈優秀さ〉が〈[完璧主義]〉になったら問うこと：「十分」とはどの程度か？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398300,
      "updated": 1792421863
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3db0000000000982cba",
      "text": "\t〈情報〉が〈[情報過多]〉になったら問うこと：本当に知るべきことは何か？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398300,
      "updated": 1792421866
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3db0000000000982cbb",
      "text": "\t〈活発さ〉が〈[やりすぎ]〉になったら問うこと：本当に注目すべきことは何か？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398300,
      "updated": 1792421870
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3db0000000000982cbc",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398300,
      "updated": 1792398300
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982cb0",
      "text": ">問いはそれぞれ、[時間泥棒]のリスクの１つに対応し、その解決策にもなっている。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792421888
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982cb1",
      "text": "[ホワイトスペースを奪う時間泥棒]という本で扱われてた[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792398290
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad5d3c70000000000982cb2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792398281,
      "updated": 1792398295
    }
  ]
}